# Reply Portal admin passcode — set this as a Cloudflare Pages encrypted
# environment variable (Pages → Settings → Environment Variables), NOT as a
# VITE_-prefixed var. VITE_* vars get bundled into the public JS; this one is
# read only server-side by the Pages Functions in functions/, so it never
# reaches the browser.
ADMIN_PASSCODE=

# Required for local testing with `npm run dev:functions` (wrangler pages dev).
# Not needed for `npm run dev` (plain Vite) — the Functions simply won't run
# and the UI falls back to this browser's localStorage automatically.
